# ===== Godot (game/) =====
# IMPORTANT: the Godot import cache (game/.godot/) is INTENTIONALLY committed.
# It carries the imported textures/meshes and the .md5 fingerprints that make
# Godot SKIP re-importing on a fresh clone. Without it, a clone re-imports from
# scratch and regenerates the save_to_file animation .res with loop_mode=0
# (loops lost) and rebuilds materials (white objects). So do NOT ignore .godot/.
#
# Only the GPU-specific, regenerated shader cache is excluded:
/game/.godot/shader_cache/
/game/.godot/mono/
/game/android/

# ===== JaCaMo / Gradle (mind/) =====
# Build output and Gradle cache: regenerated by `gradle run`.
/mind/build/
/mind/.gradle/
/mind/bin/

# ===== Logs / local databases =====
*.log
ruvector.db
*.db

# ===== OS / editor cruft =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
